---
description: items.json and courses.json schema conventions
globs: data/**/*.json,lib/**/*.js
alwaysApply: false
---

items.json: array of items, each with { id, section, text, options[]
(each option has text + category tag), or for sliders/fields: type,
category, scoringRule }. IDs follow INT-XX / SKL-XX / ACA-XX convention.

courses.json: array of 24 courses, each with { courseId, courseName,
category, overview, schools[] (name, location, type), careerOpportunities[]
(jobTitle, salaryRange, notes), salarySource, salaryAsOf, guidanceTips }.

Category name strings MUST exactly match across items.json, courses.json,
and weightTable.js (e.g., "Information Technology & Computing") — never
abbreviate or reword, since mismatched strings silently break the scoring
match. Full schema reference: instructions.md Sections 5 and 7.